{
  "_comment": [
    "Maps Hevy exercises onto the lifts in standards.json.",
    "",
    "'rules' are tried in order against the lowercased exercise title and the",
    "FIRST match wins, so specific variants must come before their base lift",
    "(incline bench before bench, dumbbell bench before bench).",
    "",
    "'overrides' maps a Hevy exercise_template_id directly to a lift id and",
    "always beats the rules. Use it for custom exercises, or when a title is",
    "ambiguous. Set a lift to null to exclude an exercise from benchmarking."
  ],
  "overrides": {},
  "rules": [
